            "Shades of your future start to unfold in this quiet corner of Kanto.",
            "The air is filled with the scent of fresh grass and new beginnings."
          ],
          "NPCs": [
            {
              "Name": "Professor Oak",
              "Role": "Guide",
              "Dialogue": [
                "Hello there! Welcome to the world of POKEMON! My name is OAK!",
                "People call me the POKEMON PROF!",
                "This world is inhabited by creatures called POKEMON!",
                "For some people, POKEMON are pets. Others use them for fights. Myself... I study POKEMON as a profession.",
                "First, what is your name?"
              ],
              "Action": "None"
            }
          ]
        },
